  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.8.5: lower fixed per-image costs and better behaviour under concurrent use, with identical output: RCT search costs each distinct channel once, shared library quantization tables, coefficient orders sized to the used transforms, lazily parsed ICC output target, per-worker scratch created only for workers that get work. Small images encode up to 2x and decode up to 1.5x faster; small lossy encodes allocate 3x less. No API changes. See docs/releases/release-0.8.5.md and docs/benchmarks/speed.md.",
